{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22145","headline":"效陶潜体诗十六首 十六 · 白居易","name":"效陶潜体诗十六首 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"济水澄而洁，河水浑而黄。\n交流列四渎，清浊不相伤。\n太公战牧野，伯夷饿首阳。\n同时号贤圣，进退不相妨。\n谓天不爱民，胡爲生稻粱。\n谓天果爱民，胡爲生豺狼。\n谓神福善人，孔圣竟栖遑。\n谓神祸淫人，暴秦终霸王。\n颜回与黄宪，何辜早夭亡。\n蝮蛇与鸩鸟，何得寿延长。\n物理不可测，神道亦难量。\n举头仰问天，天色但苍苍。\n唯当多种黍，日醉手中觞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}